><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250709161352+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250709161354+10'00'" name="e507c928-1211-4841-b3ad-e707009ee84a" page="6" coords="313.754150,248.570313,549.473755,248.570313,313.754150,237.280212,549.473755,237.280212,313.754150,235.590179,549.432373,235.590179,313.754150,224.300079,549.432373,224.300079,313.754181,222.550049,549.485474,222.550049,313.754181,211.259949,549.485474,211.259949,313.754181,209.569916,549.495605,209.569916,313.754181,198.279816,549.495605,198.279816,313.754181,196.589783,549.486206,196.589783,313.754181,185.299683,549.486206,185.299683,313.754181,183.609650,549.446533,183.609650,313.754181,172.319550,549.446533,172.319550,313.744171,170.569519,549.472351,170.569519,313.744171,159.279419,549.472351,159.279419,313.744171,157.589386,549.469482,157.589386,313.744171,146.299286,549.469482,146.299286,313.754181,144.609253,472.923553,144.609253,313.754181,133.319153,472.923553,133.319153" rect="313.391357,132.966339,549.848389,248.923126" subject="Comment on Text" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>However, given the anecdotal evidence that boxing&#xD;training sessions regularly involve fatiguing fitness circuits&#xD;(often including technical drills in combination&#xD;with rowing-based exercises and/or other repeated&#xD;lower limb movements), the data in this study provide&#xD;an argument for coaches to avoid this “traditional”&#xD;style of training session, particularly before boxingspecific&#xD;muscle power training sessions to ensure the&#xD;quality of the sport-specific session.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="6" rect="609.448975,156.570312,793.448975,248.570313"
/></highlight
